# Yearly canone TV reminder (supercronic crontab), 09:00 Europe/Rome.
#
# send_reminders dedups per (subscriber, year) via ReminderEvent, so a daily run
# is idempotent: each subscriber is emailed at most once per reference year and a
# failed day just retries tomorrow. The wording is picked by deadline_note().
#
# Full-year campaign (Dec + Jan): reference year is next year, wording targets
# the 31 January full-year exemption. Also catches subscribers who join in
# January, in time for that deadline.
0 9 * 12,1 * cd /app && uv run --no-sync --project server python -m server.send_reminders
# 2nd-semester fallback (May + June): reference year is the current year, so only
# late subscribers (who joined after the Dec/Jan send) still lack an event and get
# reminded, with wording targeting the 30 June half-year exemption.
0 9 * 5,6 * cd /app && uv run --no-sync --project server python -m server.send_reminders
